{"998400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trans-Siberian Railway Simulator", "steam_appid": 998400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of three game modes:</strong> develop a legitimate career as a train driver, fight for survival at all costs, or take a job for the Soviet mafia and discover the dark story of the railway underworld.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.poster.avif?t=1786619282\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.webm?t=1786619282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.mp4?t=1786619282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>  </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the grim realities of the late '80s, where a powerful locomotive is your home, means of transport, and tool for earning money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation of the iconic VL10 locomotive</strong> - choose between simplified and realistic controls and procedures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Railway traffic</strong> - obey signs and signals, avoid derailments and damage to the locomotive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repairs and maintenance</strong> - monitor part wear and replace components before disaster strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy and trade</strong> - make money transporting cargo. Buy food, tools, locomotive parts, and weapons. Sell hunting trophies, meat, loot, and scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and combat</strong> - use weapons for hunting, self-defense, or robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Law and order</strong> - the Militia keeps order, and civilians defend their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival system</strong> - control hunger, thirst, illness, hypothermia, alcohol, and hangover levels to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and day-night cycle</strong> - blizzards, night, and fog affect visibility. Low temperatures can kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route</strong> - about 840 km in 1:1 scale, with many places and activities to discover.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of three game modes:</strong> develop a legitimate career as a train driver, fight for survival at all costs, or take a job for the Soviet mafia and discover the dark story of the railway underworld.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.poster.avif?t=1786619282\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.webm?t=1786619282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.mp4?t=1786619282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>  </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the grim realities of the late '80s, where a powerful locomotive is your home, means of transport, and tool for earning money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation of the iconic VL10 locomotive</strong> - choose between simplified and realistic controls and procedures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Railway traffic</strong> - obey signs and signals, avoid derailments and damage to the locomotive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repairs and maintenance</strong> - monitor part wear and replace components before disaster strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy and trade</strong> - make money transporting cargo. Buy food, tools, locomotive parts, and weapons. Sell hunting trophies, meat, loot, and scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and combat</strong> - use weapons for hunting, self-defense, or robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Law and order</strong> - the Militia keeps order, and civilians defend their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival system</strong> - control hunger, thirst, illness, hypothermia, alcohol, and hangover levels to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and day-night cycle</strong> - blizzards, night, and fog affect visibility. Low temperatures can kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route</strong> - about 840 km in 1:1 scale, with many places and activities to discover.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Take control of a Soviet locomotive and embark on a dangerous journey along the world's longest railway line. Face mafia rivals, bandits, wild animals, constant breakdowns, severe frosts, hunger, and... a hangover. How far will you get before your supplies run out?", "supported_languages": "English, German, Polish, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Japanese, Czech, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/header.jpg?t=1786619282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s